\paragraph{QM9.} QM9 \citep{Ramakrishnan2014, qm9_dataset} was read through PyTorch Geometric \citep{pytorchGeometric}, which distributes 130,831 molecules. Of these, 129,428 parse in RDKit. From these, 10,000 molecules were drawn once at random, and InChIKey deduplication removes 22, leaving 9,978. The label is the HOMO--LUMO gap in eV, from 1.88 to 11.37 eV in this sample.

